    "note": "Compared every build, runtime, optional development and Node registry candidate with the 0.45.3 receipt, including candidates outside upper bounds. Only Hypothesis changed, from 6.168.3 to 6.168.5. Reviewed official notes https://github.com/HypothesisWorks/hypothesis/releases/tag/v6.168.4 (PyPy 3.12 support) and https://github.com/HypothesisWorks/hypothesis/releases/tag/v6.168.5 (Django from_field type annotation). Installed 6.168.5 in the repository-local Python 3.14 environment for validation; schema codec property tests and strict mypy pass. All latest candidates satisfy existing ranges and declare Python 3.14 support; runtime and Node candidates are unchanged. Core 0.45.4 preserves public signatures, outcomes and schema while scheduling fresh orphan releases before new database cleanup; four consumer ranges >=0.43.0,<0.46.0 accept it. Repository gates, candidate-wheel resolution and deployment acceptance are reported separately.",
